      "Brain MRI may show nonspecific findings or mild structural abnormalities",
      "Skeletal X-rays showing clinodactyly or other anomalies"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "Ring chromosome 21 detected by conventional karyotyping",
      "FISH or microarray may identify breakpoints and deletions"
    ],
